@startuml
title FE-13 Send Message with Scope and Idempotency Checks
actor Participant
participant ConsultationController
participant ConsultationApplicationService
database ConsultationIdempotencyRecordRepository
database ConsultationMessageRepository
database ConsultationAuditEventRepository
Participant -> ConsultationController : send UTF-8 text + key
ConsultationController -> ConsultationApplicationService : authenticate and authorize participant
ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationIdempotencyRecordRepository : find command key
alt new command
  ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationMessageRepository : save immutable message
  ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationAuditEventRepository : save safe metadata audit
  ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationIdempotencyRecordRepository : save outcome
else same key and same payload
  ConsultationApplicationService --> ConsultationController : return original result
else same key and changed payload
  ConsultationApplicationService --> ConsultationController : 409 key conflict
end
ConsultationController --> Participant : message result
note over Participant,ConsultationController
Empty, overlong, closed or rate-limited commands are rejected.
end note
@enduml
